   "title": "What was reused (forced question)",
   "items": [
    "notify()'s own call site: the mirror fires where the wake fires",
    "_wake_tid / _wake_identity: one transition identity, sent as Idempotency-Key",
    "owner_setting + events.jsonl + the wake.jsonl dedupe law: no second store"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Default-off + fail-open",
   "items": [
    "Setting unset = byte-identical run loop; enabled:false is a carrier-proof floor",
    "url and bearer are operator-only; https (loopback http) only; 3xx never followed",
    "A dead endpoint never raises into the run loop: typed outbound.failed + ledger row"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Pack fix (the review blocker)",
   "items": [
    "wf.py loads hooks_outbound.py by file path, so only INCLUDE_FILES ships it",
